<%# Applicant "your password was set or changed" email (MH-408), in the look of the
    reset email (MH-410). Devise looks in <scope>/mailer before devise/mailer. %>
<p>Hi,</p>
<p>Your <strong>Kynetic</strong> password was set or changed just now, for the account <%= @resource.email %>.</p>
<p>If this was you, there is nothing more to do. You can always sign in with a code sent to your email instead.</p>
<p>If this wasn't you, please contact the person who invited you straight away. Sign in with an emailed code to check your account, and set a new password if you use one.</p>
